Evolve Java adaptation

Based on Evolve Idle by Peter Motschmann and contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/pmotschmann/Evolve
Source reference: repository revision 3436358d (package version 1.4.10).

Java gameplay rules, extracted species/genus data, and localized text are
adapted from the original source and remain under Mozilla Public License 2.0.
The full license is included in META-INF/LICENSE and in the repository root.
Preserve these notices when moving this code into another project.

Gson, used only by storage-json, is licensed under Apache License 2.0.
JUnit is used only for development and is not part of the runtime core.
The desktop preview uses the JDK's Swing toolkit and is not a mod dependency.
